; Gosper curve (flowsnake), order 4 - ONE continuous stroke, no pen lifts.
; A hexagonal space-filling fractal. Fills the area like a lumpy snowflake -
; completely different texture to the Hilbert's right angles.
;
;   >>> Place the pen near the TOP edge, RIGHT side of your paper. <<<
;   From the pen it draws both LEFT and RIGHT (96 mm left, 54 mm right)
;   and mostly DOWN, toward you (141 mm down, 0 mm up).
;
